    "story": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "sub": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Our story"
          }
        },
        "h": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Integrity, great service and a huge range",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "t": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We're an Australian online board game store based in Sydney. We keep prices fair by running a lean operation and passing the savings on, and we go out of our way to find the hard-to-find games.</p><p>You're not just a customer: we see you as a friend who shares our passion for the hobby.</p><p>Find Dean on BoardGameGeek: <a href=\"https://boardgamegeek.com/user/Caldris\">Caldris</a></p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "sub",
        "h",
        "t"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/story.jpg",
        "layout": "left",
        "image_fit": "cover",
        "media_width": 50,
        "media_scale": 100,
        "text_align": "text-start",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "only_content_color_scheme": false
      }
    },
    "dean": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "sub": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Meet Dean"
          }
        },
        "h": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The person behind the parcels",
            "heading_size": "h4",
            "heading_h1": false
          }
        },
        "t": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Advent Games is run by Dean, a Sydney board gamer who wanted Australian players to get great games at fair prices, without the hunt. You'll find him on BoardGameGeek as Caldris, and on Tuesday nights at the Northside Gamers Group in Chatswood, which is where our free pickups happen.</p><p>What began as a small online shop has grown into a range of more than 11,000 games, from family favourites to heavy euros, wargames and roleplaying books. We still go out of our way to track down the hard-to-find titles, and we open preorders early so you don't miss the big releases.</p><p>We're still small and owner-operated. When you get in touch, Dean replies himself: not a call centre, and not an AI.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "sub",
        "h",
        "t"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/dean.jpg",
        "layout": "right",
        "image_fit": "cover",
        "media_width": 50,
        "media_scale": 100,
        "text_align": "text-start",
        "color_scheme": "none",
        "only_content_color_scheme": false
      }
    },
